OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGerman far-right set for big win in
OL,4,Aeastern state, projections show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe AfD's charismatic leader in the
OL,7,Fstate, Ulrich Siegmund, said it was
OL,8,F"sensational" and they wanted to start
OL,9,Fgoverning as soon as possible.
OL,11,FNo far-right party has won control of a
OL,12,FGerman state since World War Two, and
OL,13,Fgoverning at state level would mean
OL,14,Fpowers over policing, local education
OL,15,Fand culture.
